{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455180/extras/4d67f02715b8177c87c310fceb0fcda8.poster.avif?t=1695502966\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455180/extras/4d67f02715b8177c87c310fceb0fcda8.webm?t=1695502966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455180/extras/4d67f02715b8177c87c310fceb0fcda8.mp4?t=1695502966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Get lost in a beautiful forest. Run around and have fun discovering new areas. Do it your way, at your pace! Collect different goodies such as pine cones for trading, wooden planks for building, and fun items like hats! How many pine cones can you find?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455180/extras/83234b11ddcdebe5e8a1413cbd3214fd.poster.avif?t=1695502966\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455180/extras/83234b11ddcdebe5e8a1413cbd3214fd.webm?t=1695502966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455180/extras/83234b11ddcdebe5e8a1413cbd3214fd.mp4?t=1695502966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This game is almost entirely illustration-based! No text = No problem! No matter who you are, what language you speak, or what level of reader you are - we want you to be able to enjoy this game!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455180/extras/22fdabc7eae95ec6ab135c0a2967ebc5.poster.avif?t=1695502966\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455180/extras/22fdabc7eae95ec6ab135c0a2967ebc5.webm?t=1695502966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455180/extras/22fdabc7eae95ec6ab135c0a2967ebc5.mp4?t=1695502966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Collect cool hats and feel fashionable throughout your adventure! How many hats will you get? Find out by exploring every nook and cranny around the forest! Make new friends and help them along the way of your journey!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455180/extras/1e3327f8705cb9ee97571061ab793e9c.avif?t=1695502966\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br>We are Sp\u00e5ng Studios, a tiny and close nit group of students studying game design in Sweden! We have come together during this three month long project to develop a fun adventurous game. We are super excited to work on more projects in the future and hope to see you once again soon!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2455180?t=1695502966","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1695502966","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455180/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1695502966","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455180/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1695502966","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455180/extras/4d67f02715b8177c87c310fceb0fcda8.post